      "message": "On second thought, it might be useful to put a check on oops_in_progress in this function.\n\nif (likely(!oops_in_progress))\n    return;\n\nGreg, please let me know about your thoughts on this.",
      "parentUuid": "dfebb9e2_a65fe725",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 186,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 187,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "519b9a82e989165e45cc2bbe25ae4f1c4532577c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
